{"id":"forecast-09","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-09/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":355.23,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":2.12,"text":"Now turn to Section 3.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.56],["turn",0.56,0.96],["to",0.96,1.18],["Section",1.18,1.54],["3.",1.54,2.12]]},{"start":3.02,"end":10.6,"text":"Section 3. You will hear two students called Eva and Mike discussing their research project on tourism.","words":[["Section",3.02,3.26],["3.",3.26,3.8],["You",4.26,4.5],["will",4.5,4.74],["hear",4.74,4.98],["two",4.98,5.3],["students",5.3,5.84],["called",5.84,6.32],["Eva",6.32,6.74],["and",6.74,7.14],["Mike",7.14,7.52],["discussing",7.52,8.34],["their",8.34,8.74],["research",8.74,9.2],["project",9.2,9.86],["on",9.86,10.14],["tourism.",10.14,10.6]]},{"start":11.34,"end":16.04,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 21 to 26.","words":[["First,",11.34,11.66],["you",12.1,12.26],["have",12.26,12.52],["some",12.52,12.76],["time",12.76,13.12],["to",13.12,13.34],["look",13.34,13.6],["at",13.6,13.84],["questions",13.84,14.2],["21",14.2,15.06],["to",15.06,15.36],["26.",15.36,16.04]]},{"start":16.88,"end":21.68,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["Now",16.88,17.38],["listen",17.38,17.7],["carefully",17.7,18.2],["and",18.2,18.86],["answer",18.86,19.32],["questions",19.32,19.78],["21",19.78,20.7],["to",20.7,20.98],["26.",20.98,21.68]]},{"start":22.4,"end":27.34,"text":"Hi Eva, is this a good time for us to look at our research project?","words":[["Hi",22.4,23.04],["Eva,",23.04,23.46],["is",24.12,24.4],["this",24.4,24.58],["a",24.58,24.74],["good",24.74,24.92],["time",24.92,25.24],["for",25.24,25.44],["us",25.44,25.58],["to",25.58,25.74],["look",25.74,25.94],["at",25.94,26.1],["our",26.1,26.3],["research",26.3,26.68],["project?",26.68,27.34]]},{"start":27.9,"end":30.44,"text":"Our tutor told us to keep the focus narrow.","words":[["Our",27.9,28.14],["tutor",28.14,28.42],["told",28.42,28.82],["us",28.82,29.04],["to",29.04,29.22],["keep",29.22,29.42],["the",29.42,29.66],["focus",29.66,29.94],["narrow.",29.94,30.44]]},{"start":31.02,"end":37.22,"text":"So what about we go for why people choose to go to certain places and attractions and","words":[["So",31.02,31.4],["what",31.4,31.74],["about",31.74,32.04],["we",32.04,32.34],["go",32.34,32.6],["for",32.6,32.9],["why",32.9,33.28],["people",33.28,33.7],["choose",33.7,34.02],["to",34.02,34.28],["go",34.28,34.48],["to",34.48,34.66],["certain",34.66,35.0],["places",35.0,35.46],["and",35.46,35.94],["attractions",35.94,36.44],["and",36.44,37.22]]},{"start":37.22,"end":38.32,"text":"leave the rest out?","words":[["leave",37.22,37.42],["the",37.42,37.62],["rest",37.62,37.92],["out?",37.92,38.32]]},{"start":38.68,"end":43.62,"text":"You're right, otherwise we'll have far too much information to cope with.","words":[["You're",38.68,39.06],["right,",39.06,39.48],["otherwise",39.98,40.42],["we'll",40.42,40.92],["have",40.92,41.14],["far",41.14,41.48],["too",41.48,41.76],["much",41.76,42.04],["information",42.04,42.62],["to",42.62,43.02],["cope",43.02,43.28],["with.",43.28,43.62]]},{"start":44.1,"end":46.38,"text":"Okay, so what about the survey?","words":[["Okay,",44.1,44.6],["so",44.76,45.06],["what",45.06,45.46],["about",45.46,45.72],["the",45.72,45.92],["survey?",45.92,46.38]]},{"start":46.38,"end":52.38,"text":"Well, I've looked through the ideas we had for questions for it, and I think it's not","words":[["Well,",46.38,47.42],["I've",47.88,48.24],["looked",48.24,48.4],["through",48.4,48.68],["the",48.68,48.86],["ideas",48.86,49.32],["we",49.32,49.56],["had",49.56,49.8],["for",49.8,50.02],["questions",50.02,50.46],["for",50.46,50.92],["it,",50.92,51.14],["and",51.3,51.54],["I",51.54,51.7],["think",51.7,51.88],["it's",51.88,52.16],["not",52.16,52.38]]},{"start":52.38,"end":58.8,"text":"clear how we use the word area. Sometimes it seems to mean a place, other times the field","words":[["clear",52.38,52.78],["how",52.78,53.08],["we",53.08,53.26],["use",53.26,53.52],["the",53.52,53.68],["word",53.68,53.96],["area.",53.96,54.48],["Sometimes",55.16,55.64],["it",55.64,56.08],["seems",56.08,56.34],["to",56.34,56.56],["mean",56.56,56.74],["a",56.74,56.9],["place,",56.9,57.24],["other",57.74,58.0],["times",58.0,58.3],["the",58.3,58.54],["field",58.54,58.8]]},{"start":58.8,"end":62.84,"text":"of our research, and even tourist attraction in some cases.","words":[["of",58.8,58.94],["our",58.94,59.08],["research,",59.08,59.54],["and",60.02,60.42],["even",60.42,60.76],["tourist",60.76,61.1],["attraction",61.1,61.76],["in",61.76,62.14],["some",62.14,62.38],["cases.",62.38,62.84]]},{"start":63.16,"end":67.16,"text":"Oh, I think that's my fault. I typed out our notes.","words":[["Oh,",63.16,63.56],["I",63.78,64.04],["think",64.04,64.22],["that's",64.22,64.58],["my",64.58,64.84],["fault.",64.84,65.2],["I",65.6,65.84],["typed",65.84,66.2],["out",66.2,66.5],["our",66.5,66.72],["notes.",66.72,67.16]]},{"start":67.86,"end":73.72,"text":"Oh, it's probably best to use it for place in the sense of province or whatever.","words":[["Oh,",67.86,68.46],["it's",68.9,69.24],["probably",69.24,69.6],["best",69.6,70.02],["to",70.02,70.24],["use",70.24,70.54],["it",70.54,70.66],["for",70.66,70.86],["place",70.86,71.26],["in",71.26,71.62],["the",71.62,71.72],["sense",71.72,72.02],["of",72.02,72.3],["province",72.3,72.82],["or",72.82,73.24],["whatever.",73.24,73.72]]},{"start":73.72,"end":81.48,"text":"Yes, I think so. You know, we decided to concentrate on culture and tourism. I wonder if we're","words":[["Yes,",73.72,74.46],["I",74.78,74.98],["think",74.98,75.26],["so.",75.26,75.6],["You",76.22,76.48],["know,",76.48,76.7],["we",76.86,76.98],["decided",76.98,77.48],["to",77.48,77.74],["concentrate",77.74,78.3],["on",78.3,78.68],["culture",78.68,79.14],["and",79.14,79.46],["tourism.",79.46,79.92],["I",80.48,80.76],["wonder",80.76,81.0],["if",81.0,81.3],["we're",81.3,81.48]]},{"start":81.48,"end":87.42,"text":"really saying culture in the same way as most people do, because on our list of places to","words":[["really",81.48,81.82],["saying",81.82,82.18],["culture",82.18,82.66],["in",82.66,82.9],["the",82.9,83.02],["same",83.02,83.36],["way",83.36,83.62],["as",83.62,83.8],["most",83.8,84.1],["people",84.1,84.46],["do,",84.46,84.8],["because",85.22,85.66],["on",85.66,86.08],["our",86.08,86.24],["list",86.24,86.52],["of",86.52,86.72],["places",86.72,87.12],["to",87.12,87.42]]},{"start":87.42,"end":93.14,"text":"carry out our surveys, I see you've put the Round Music Festival, which is contemporary","words":[["carry",87.42,87.78],["out",87.78,88.06],["our",88.06,88.2],["surveys,",88.2,88.64],["I",89.08,89.34],["see",89.34,89.62],["you've",89.62,89.96],["put",89.96,90.14],["the",90.14,90.34],["Round",90.34,90.68],["Music",90.68,91.12],["Festival,",91.12,91.66],["which",92.1,92.36],["is",92.36,92.54],["contemporary",92.54,93.14]]},{"start":93.14,"end":98.42,"text":"music. I thought we were going to be looking at more traditional forms of culture.","words":[["music.",93.14,93.8],["I",94.26,94.58],["thought",94.58,94.9],["we",94.9,95.14],["were",95.14,95.26],["going",95.26,95.54],["to",95.54,95.7],["be",95.7,95.84],["looking",95.84,96.14],["at",96.14,96.44],["more",96.44,96.66],["traditional",96.66,97.24],["forms",97.24,97.78],["of",97.78,97.96],["culture.",97.96,98.42]]},{"start":98.42,"end":106.38,"text":"That would be confirming these old-fashioned ideas that culture has to be something that's at least 100 years old.","words":[["That",98.42,99.64],["would",99.64,99.8],["be",99.8,99.96],["confirming",99.96,100.52],["these",100.52,100.92],["old",100.92,101.3],["-fashioned",101.3,101.7],["ideas",101.7,102.32],["that",102.32,102.62],["culture",102.62,102.98],["has",102.98,103.32],["to",103.32,103.52],["be",103.52,103.7],["something",103.7,104.06],["that's",104.06,104.6],["at",104.6,104.72],["least",104.72,104.92],["100",104.92,105.42],["years",105.42,105.86],["old.",105.86,106.38]]},{"start":106.62,"end":108.96,"text":"But that is what most people think.","words":[["But",106.62,106.9],["that",106.9,107.3],["is",107.3,107.58],["what",107.58,107.82],["most",107.82,108.12],["people",108.12,108.48],["think.",108.48,108.96]]},{"start":109.56,"end":113.04,"text":"Well, let's not get into an argument about that right now.","words":[["Well,",109.56,109.9],["let's",110.06,110.3],["not",110.3,110.52],["get",110.52,110.74],["into",110.74,111.02],["an",111.02,111.16],["argument",111.16,111.54],["about",111.54,111.96],["that",111.96,112.3],["right",112.3,112.64],["now.",112.64,113.04]]},{"start":113.76,"end":117.4,"text":"Let's think about the number of completed questionnaires we need.","words":[["Let's",113.76,114.2],["think",114.2,114.46],["about",114.46,114.76],["the",114.76,115.0],["number",115.0,115.3],["of",115.3,115.54],["completed",115.54,115.96],["questionnaires",115.96,116.82],["we",116.82,117.06],["need.",117.06,117.4]]},{"start":117.96,"end":121.84,"text":"In total, how many questionnaires do you think we have to get?","words":[["In",117.96,118.22],["total,",118.22,118.56],["how",119.02,119.2],["many",119.2,119.42],["questionnaires",119.42,120.3],["do",120.3,120.58],["you",120.58,120.74],["think",120.74,120.96],["we",120.96,121.18],["have",121.18,121.38],["to",121.38,121.54],["get?",121.54,121.84]]},{"start":122.3,"end":126.64,"text":"100? 200? And over how many different events?","words":[["100?",122.3,122.84],["200?",123.3,123.62],["And",124.42,124.84],["over",124.84,125.26],["how",125.26,125.58],["many",125.58,125.82],["different",125.82,126.14],["events?",126.14,126.64]]},{"start":126.64,"end":135.12,"text":"Hmm. Our tutor said we should have at least 200. Otherwise, the information won't actually mean that much.","words":[["Hmm.",126.64,127.62],["Our",128.28,128.48],["tutor",128.48,128.82],["said",128.82,129.26],["we",129.26,129.56],["should",129.56,129.76],["have",129.76,130.04],["at",130.04,130.18],["least",130.18,130.58],["200.",130.58,131.32],["Otherwise,",131.8,132.28],["the",132.52,132.68],["information",132.68,133.28],["won't",133.28,133.76],["actually",133.76,134.18],["mean",134.18,134.52],["that",134.52,134.8],["much.",134.8,135.12]]},{"start":135.6,"end":140.3,"text":"And I think it's not practical to try to go to more than about five events.","words":[["And",135.6,136.04],["I",136.04,136.3],["think",136.3,136.52],["it's",136.52,136.76],["not",136.76,136.92],["practical",136.92,137.58],["to",137.58,137.82],["try",137.82,138.08],["to",138.08,138.22],["go",138.22,138.42],["to",138.42,138.54],["more",138.54,138.8],["than",138.8,139.02],["about",139.02,139.36],["five",139.36,139.8],["events.",139.8,140.3]]},{"start":140.78,"end":143.82,"text":"We've got to get the first draft in by the end of February.","words":[["We've",140.78,141.04],["got",141.04,141.2],["to",141.2,141.38],["get",141.38,141.5],["the",141.5,141.7],["first",141.7,141.98],["draft",141.98,142.34],["in",142.34,142.68],["by",142.68,142.9],["the",142.9,143.04],["end",143.04,143.24],["of",143.24,143.36],["February.",143.36,143.82]]},{"start":144.78,"end":148.8,"text":"And do you think we should interview everybody or just tourists?","words":[["And",144.78,145.24],["do",145.24,145.54],["you",145.54,145.62],["think",145.62,145.84],["we",145.84,146.06],["should",146.06,146.26],["interview",146.26,146.76],["everybody",146.76,147.52],["or",147.52,148.04],["just",148.04,148.42],["tourists?",148.42,148.8]]},{"start":149.36,"end":156.12,"text":"Hmm. Because presumably there'd be local people, domestic tourists and international tourists","words":[["Hmm.",149.36,149.84],["Because",150.4,150.86],["presumably",150.86,151.52],["there'd",151.52,152.08],["be",152.08,152.22],["local",152.22,152.58],["people,",152.58,153.06],["domestic",153.38,153.64],["tourists",153.64,154.26],["and",154.26,154.74],["international",154.74,155.34],["tourists",155.34,156.12]]},{"start":156.12,"end":161.72,"text":"at some events. In fact, the more I think about it, the more I think we should just go","words":[["at",156.12,156.28],["some",156.28,156.64],["events.",156.64,157.12],["In",157.62,157.8],["fact,",157.8,158.2],["the",158.52,158.64],["more",158.64,158.88],["I",158.88,159.06],["think",159.06,159.28],["about",159.28,159.62],["it,",159.62,159.78],["the",159.82,159.92],["more",159.92,160.16],["I",160.16,160.42],["think",160.42,160.66],["we",160.66,160.92],["should",160.92,161.12],["just",161.12,161.48],["go",161.48,161.72]]},{"start":161.72,"end":168.18,"text":"for the tourist, but from overseas as well as national. I'm sure we'd be able to provide","words":[["for",161.72,162.02],["the",162.02,162.2],["tourist,",162.2,162.68],["but",163.16,163.44],["from",163.44,163.66],["overseas",163.66,164.18],["as",164.18,164.58],["well",164.58,164.9],["as",164.9,165.3],["national.",165.3,165.8],["I'm",166.4,166.68],["sure",166.68,166.94],["we'd",166.94,167.24],["be",167.24,167.38],["able",167.38,167.62],["to",167.62,167.8],["provide",167.8,168.18]]},{"start":168.18,"end":174.38,"text":"more interesting results if we did that. Right. There's one thing that worries me though.","words":[["more",168.18,168.5],["interesting",168.5,169.08],["results",169.08,169.76],["if",169.76,170.02],["we",170.02,170.24],["did",170.24,170.5],["that.",170.5,170.88],["Right.",171.24,171.82],["There's",172.3,172.64],["one",172.64,172.88],["thing",172.88,173.18],["that",173.18,173.42],["worries",173.42,173.8],["me",173.8,174.08],["though.",174.08,174.38]]},{"start":174.84,"end":180.06,"text":"What's that? We said it's important to get some background on the people who answer","words":[["What's",174.84,175.3],["that?",175.3,175.6],["We",176.24,176.48],["said",176.48,176.8],["it's",176.8,177.06],["important",177.06,177.46],["to",177.46,177.68],["get",177.68,177.86],["some",177.86,178.08],["background",178.08,178.54],["on",178.54,178.94],["the",178.94,179.1],["people",179.1,179.4],["who",179.4,179.64],["answer",179.64,180.06]]},{"start":180.06,"end":182.92,"text":"are questions, like what's their job?","words":[["are",180.06,180.26],["questions,",180.26,180.7],["like",181.26,181.6],["what's",181.6,182.3],["their",182.3,182.48],["job?",182.48,182.92]]},{"start":183.5,"end":185.02,"text":"What they thought about the event?","words":[["What",183.5,183.66],["they",183.66,183.86],["thought",183.86,184.1],["about",184.1,184.38],["the",184.38,184.62],["event?",184.62,185.02]]},{"start":185.66,"end":188.94,"text":"But the idea of asking people how old they are?","words":[["But",185.66,185.96],["the",185.96,186.14],["idea",186.14,186.58],["of",186.58,186.78],["asking",186.78,187.14],["people",187.14,187.58],["how",187.58,187.92],["old",187.92,188.3],["they",188.3,188.52],["are?",188.52,188.94]]},{"start":189.22,"end":195.72,"text":"We can't just ask them to tick a box with an age in it and tell them they don't have","words":[["We",189.22,189.76],["can't",189.76,191.0],["just",191.0,191.16],["ask",191.16,191.54],["them",191.54,191.78],["to",191.78,191.94],["tick",191.94,192.16],["a",192.16,192.34],["box",192.34,192.68],["with",192.68,192.9],["an",192.9,193.08],["age",193.08,193.34],["in",193.34,193.5],["it",193.5,193.7],["and",193.7,194.34],["tell",194.34,194.72],["them",194.72,195.0],["they",195.0,195.24],["don't",195.24,195.52],["have",195.52,195.72]]},{"start":195.72,"end":197.36,"text":"to do it if they don't want to.","words":[["to",195.72,195.9],["do",195.9,196.16],["it",196.16,196.32],["if",196.32,196.42],["they",196.42,196.58],["don't",196.58,196.8],["want",196.8,197.08],["to.",197.08,197.36]]},{"start":197.84,"end":200.7,"text":"We could write in our own estimate when we've finished.","words":[["We",197.84,198.08],["could",198.08,198.36],["write",198.36,198.68],["in",198.68,198.88],["our",198.88,199.08],["own",199.08,199.32],["estimate",199.32,199.82],["when",199.82,200.06],["we've",200.06,200.32],["finished.",200.32,200.7]]},{"start":201.22,"end":202.96,"text":"Are you sure that would be okay?","words":[["Are",201.22,201.42],["you",201.42,201.62],["sure",201.62,201.96],["that",201.96,202.18],["would",202.18,202.34],["be",202.34,202.54],["okay?",202.54,202.96]]},{"start":203.42,"end":207.16,"text":"Yes, it's not the most crucial piece of information they're giving.","words":[["Yes,",203.42,203.78],["it's",204.16,204.38],["not",204.38,204.58],["the",204.58,204.78],["most",204.78,205.02],["crucial",205.02,205.48],["piece",205.48,205.76],["of",205.76,205.98],["information",205.98,206.5],["they're",206.5,206.86],["giving.",206.86,207.16]]},{"start":207.16,"end":211.28,"text":"We're going to have a lot of facts and figures to present.","words":[["We're",207.16,208.3],["going",208.3,208.5],["to",208.5,208.66],["have",208.66,208.9],["a",208.9,209.02],["lot",209.02,209.34],["of",209.34,209.58],["facts",209.58,209.88],["and",209.88,210.14],["figures",210.14,210.52],["to",210.52,210.82],["present.",210.82,211.28]]},{"start":211.92,"end":216.62,"text":"Have you any preference for putting them into a pie chart, a table, or a graph?","words":[["Have",211.92,212.1],["you",212.1,212.32],["any",212.32,212.6],["preference",212.6,213.1],["for",213.1,213.5],["putting",213.5,213.82],["them",213.82,214.06],["into",214.06,214.34],["a",214.34,214.52],["pie",214.52,214.76],["chart,",214.76,215.12],["a",215.36,215.46],["table,",215.46,215.8],["or",216.04,216.2],["a",216.2,216.34],["graph?",216.34,216.62]]},{"start":217.18,"end":223.42,"text":"Tables are easy to do, but I read that most people find pie charts visually stimulating.","words":[["Tables",217.18,217.7],["are",217.7,217.92],["easy",217.92,218.22],["to",218.22,218.42],["do,",218.42,218.78],["but",219.26,219.66],["I",219.66,219.98],["read",219.98,220.24],["that",220.24,220.4],["most",220.4,220.62],["people",220.62,220.98],["find",220.98,221.34],["pie",221.34,221.68],["charts",221.68,222.04],["visually",222.04,222.56],["stimulating.",222.56,223.42]]},{"start":224.04,"end":229.88,"text":"I hate reading graphs because, unless they're quite big, you don't get exact figures.","words"